    "body": "## What does this PR do?\nAdds a dated Nemotron 3.5 Super VL release announcement to the README News section.\n\n## Changelog\n- Summarize checkpoint conversion, image inference, training recipes, and text-only workflows.\n- Link the model documentation and verification card for verified configurations and limitations.\n- No implementation or verification-record changes.\n\n## GitHub Actions CI\nAll-file pre-commit and git diff --check passed. Both relative link targets exist. Independent review completed; wording was narrowed to avoid implying verified video inference. Runtime tests are not applicable to this README-only change.\n\n## Before your PR is Ready for review\n- [x] Followed contributor guidelines.\n- [x] Updated documentation.\n- [x] Checked links and reviewed claims against documentation/card.\n- [ ] Optional-component changes (not applicable).\n\n## Additional Information\nFollows the publication restoration in #6482.",
    "changed_files": 1,
